  Great League Edition will run from September 22\, 2026\, at 1:00 p.m. to 
 September 29\, 2026\, at 1:00 p.m. PT.\nTrainers will also receive 4× Sta
 rdust from win rewards (this does not include end-of-set rewards).\n\n▸ 
 Ultra League\n• Pokémon must be at or below 2\,500 CP to enter.\n\n▸ 
 Master League: Mega Edition\n• No CP limit.\n• Mega-Evolved Pokémon a
 re allowed.\n\n▸ Retro Cup: Great League Edition\n• Pokémon must be a
 t or below 1\,500 CP to enter.\n• Dark-\, Steel-\, and Fairy-type Pokém
 on are not eligible.\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/gbl-twilight-trai
 ls_ultra-league_master-league-mega-edition_retro-cup-great-league-edition/
