 so be a Raid Hour featuring these regional raid bosses from 6:00 p.m. to 7
 :00 p.m. local time on September 23.\n\n━━ RAIDS ━━\nXurkitree\, P
 heromosa\, and Buzzwole will be in five-star raid battles in their respect
 ive regions listed above.\nPokémon: Buzzwole\, Pheromosa\, Xurkitree\n\n
