BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:choose-your-path-twilight-trails-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261023T191227Z
SUMMARY:Choose Your Path: Twilight Trails
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20260923T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20260928T200000
DESCRIPTION:Choose Your Path Timed Research gives you the freedom to explor
 e Pokémon GO your way during non-event weeks!\nDuring a Choose Your Path 
 Timed Research week\, you’ll be able to select one of three paths: Explo
 re\, Catch\, or Battle. Your choice will shape the Timed Research tasks an
 d bonuses throughout the week.\nYou may have different research opportunit
 ies than other Trainers. Some Trainers can choose one bonus for the week\,
  while others can choose a bonus and receive new Timed Research each day.\
 n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Choose a Path\nFor the single-bonus version
 \, you can choose one of the following Timed Research paths:\n• Explore 
 (PokéStops)\n• Catch (Candy)\n• Battle (Team GO Rocket)\nFor the sing
 le-bonus version\, choose one path for the week. Once selected\, your path
  cannot be changed. Your choice determines your Timed Research tasks and g
 rants the corresponding bonus below.\n• Explore (PokéStops): 5× XP for
  spinning PokéStops\n• Catch (Candy): 2× Candy for catching Pokémon\n
 • Battle (Team GO Rocket): Extra Mysterious Components from Team GO Rock
 et Grunts\n\n▸ Daily Bonus Choices\nSome Trainers can choose a bonus eac
 h day instead. The daily choices include:\n• Explore (PokéStops): 5× X
 P for spinning PokéStops\n• Catch (Stardust): 2× Stardust for catching
  Pokémon\n• Catch (Candy): 2× Candy for catching Pokémon\n• Battle 
 (Team GO Rocket): Extra Mysterious Components from Team GO Rocket Grunts\n
 Each daily choice grants Timed Research. You can choose a new bonus and re
 ceive new Timed Research each day of the event.\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\
 n▸ Field Research\nEvent Field Research tasks are available. Each task r
 ewards 1 Rare Candy.\n• Make 5 Nice Throws → Rare Candy ×1\n• Defea
 t a Team GO Rocket Grunt → Rare Candy ×1\n• Explore 1 km → Rare Can
 dy ×1\n\n▸ Timed Research Details\nThe following Timed Research is avai
 lable for the single-bonus version. Each path awards 5 Rare Candy\, 5\,000
  XP\, and 5\,000 Stardust upon completion\, in addition to the individual 
 task rewards.\nChoose Explore (PokéStops) to get 5× XP for spinning Pok
 éStops.\nChoose Catch (Candy) to get 2× Candy for catching Pokémon.\nCh
 oose Battle (Team GO Rocket) to get extra Mysterious Components from Team 
 GO Rocket Grunts.\n\n▸ Daily Timed Research\nSome Trainers receive daily
  Timed Research instead of the single-bonus version above. Tasks and rewar
 ds are listed below.\nChoose Explore (PokéStops) for the day to get 5× X
 P for spinning PokéStops.\nChoose Catch (Candy) for the day to get 2× Ca
 ndy for catching Pokémon.\nChoose Battle (Team GO Rocket) for the day to 
 get extra Mysterious Components from Team GO Rocket Grunts.\n\n🔗 https:
 //leekduck.com/events/choose-your-path-twilight-trails-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/choose-your-path-twilight-trails-2026/
