SUMMARY:Brisbane\, Australia - Pokémon GO City Safari
DTSTART:20260926T000000Z
DTEND:20260927T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Pokémon GO City Safari takes place in Brisbane\, Australia\, o
 n September 26 and 27\, 2026\, from 10 am to 6 pm AEST each day. One-day t
 ickets cost AU$17\, including taxes and fees. Event gameplay requires a ti
 cket and attendance in Brisbane.\nOfficial event details\n\n━━ BONUSES
  ━━\n▸ Ticket Holder Bonuses\nThese bonuses apply during your ticket
 ed session in Brisbane.\n• Increased Shiny chance\n• Four-hour Lure Mo
 dules (excluding Golden Lure Modules)\n• Up to five Special Trades\n• 
 Half Stardust cost for trades\n• Tiny Compass buddy souvenir\n• Eight-
 hour Party Play\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Eevee wearing an explorer h
 at\nBegin the event research to encounter Eevee wearing an explorer hat. I
 t can evolve into any of its eight Evolutions.\nPokémon: Explorer Eevee\n
 \n▸ GO Stamp Rally\nCollect up to eight stamps daily for explorer-hat Ee
 vee encounters. The stamp rally replaces the previous Eevee Explorers Time
 d Research.\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\nThe following Pokémon will appear in
  the wild.\nPokémon: Jigglypuff\, Abra\, Slowpoke\, Totodile\, Mareep\, M
 arill\, Hoppip\, Unown B\, Unown L\, Unown M\, Unown R\, Stantler\, Miltan
 k\, Wingull\, Baltoy\, Buizel\, Lillipup\, Petilil\, Yamask\, Gothita\, Or
 ange Flower Flabébé\, Binacle\, Clauncher\, Hawlucha\, Mudbray\, Orangur
 u\, Komala\, Flamigo\n\n━━ EGGS ━━\n▸ In 7 km Eggs\nPokémon: Or
 ange Flower Flabébé\, Hawlucha\, Mudbray\, Komala\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━
 ━\n▸ Field Research Tasks\nThese are the known event-exclusive Field R
 esearch tasks.\n• Catch 5 Pokémon → Stardust ×1000\n• Catch 15 Pok
 émon → Mudbray\n• Catch 20 Pokémon → Rare Candy ×1\n• Catch 5 d
 ifferent species of Pokémon → Mudbray\n• Take a snapshot of your budd
 y → Stardust ×1000\nAfter completing the first step\, choose double Inc
 ense\, Star Piece\, or Lucky Egg duration for the remainder of your ticket
 ed session.\n\n▸ Double Incense Duration\nChoose this bonus to double In
 cense duration for the remainder of your ticketed session.\n\n▸ Double S
 tar Piece Duration\nChoose this bonus to double Star Piece duration for th
 e remainder of your ticketed session.\nThe tasks and rewards below are bas
 ed on previous City Safari events and the confirmed Brisbane Incense path.
  The Star Piece path rewards have not yet been confirmed.\n\n▸ Double Lu
 cky Egg Duration\nChoose this bonus to double Lucky Egg duration for the r
 emainder of your ticketed session.\nThe tasks and rewards below are based 
 on previous City Safari events and the confirmed Brisbane Incense path. Th
 e Lucky Egg path rewards have not yet been confirmed.\n\n🔗 https://leek
 duck.com/events/pokemon-go-city-safari-brisbane-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/pokemon-go-city-safari-brisbane-2026/
