SUMMARY:Phantump Catch Mastery
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20260926T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20260926T200000
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a Catch Mastery event featuring Phantump\, the St
 ump Pokémon!\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\n• 2× XP for successfully catchi
 ng Pokémon with Nice Throws or better\n• Increased Candy for successful
 ly catching Pokémon with Nice Throws or better\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\
 n▸ Featured Pokémon\nPhantump\, the Stump Pokémon\, will appear in Fie
 ld Research\, free Timed Research\, and paid Timed Research.\nPokémon: Ph
 antump\nYou’ll have an increased chance of encountering Shiny Phantump!\
 n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\n▸ Wild Encounters\nThe following Pokémon will 
 appear more frequently in the wild.\nPokémon: Cherubi\, Drifloon\n\n━
 ━ RESEARCH ━━\n▸ Field Research Task Encounters\nTasks focused on 
 your Poké Ball–throwing accuracy will be available! The following Poké
 mon will be available to encounter when you complete Field Research tasks!
 \n• Make 10 Nice Throws → Drifloon\, Phantump\n• Make 3 Great Throws
  in a row → Phantump\n• Make 7 Great Throws → Cherubi\, Phantump\n
 • Make an Excellent Throw → Phantump\nTimed Research focused on catchi
 ng Phantump will be available throughout the event!\nTimed Research reward
 s include the following:\n• Complete research tasks for encounters with 
 Phantump!\n• XP\, Stardust\, and more!\nYou’ll have an increased chanc
 e of encountering Shiny Phantump!\nFor US$1.99 (or the equivalent pricing 
 tier in your local currency)\, you’ll be able to access event-exclusive 
 Timed Research.\nPaid Timed Research rewards include the following:\n• A
 dditional encounters with Phantump\n• XP\, Stardust and more!\nYou’ll 
 have an increased chance of encountering Shiny Phantump!\n\n━━ SHINY 
 ━━\n▸ Increased Shiny Chance\nThere will be an increased chance to e
 ncounter Shiny Cherubi\, Shiny Drifloon\, and Shiny Phantump.\nPokémon: C
 herubi\, Drifloon\, Phantump\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/catch-mas
 tery-phantump-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/catch-mastery-phantump-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
