BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:harvest-festival-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261023T191227Z
SUMMARY:Harvest Festival 2026: Applin Picking
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20260929T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261005T200000
DESCRIPTION:Harvest Festival returns with the Pokémon GO debut of Shiny Ap
 plin! Gather apples\, choose a Timed Research path\, and earn rewards thro
 ugh the event GO Pass.\nThe Harvest Festival 2026: Applin Picking event wi
 ll take place from September 29\, 2026 at 10 am to October 5\, 2026 at 8 p
 m local time.\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\n• Increased chance to encounter 
 Shiny Smoliv\nUnlock the following bonuses by reaching Major Milestones on
  the event GO Pass.\n\n▸ Tier 1 Bonus – Starting at Rank 1\n• Applin
  will have an increased chance of holding Tart Apples\, Sweet Apples\, or 
 Syrupy Apples when caught\n\n▸ Tier 2 Bonus – Starting at Rank 10\n•
  Mossy Lure Modules activated during the event will last for one hour\n\n
 ▸ Tier 3 Bonus – Starting at Rank 20\n• More Stardust from defeating
  Team GO Rocket Grunts and Leaders\nAdditional bonus tasks for this GO Pas
 s will be available during the event.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Apple
 s\nDuring the event\, Mossy Lure Modules will only attract apples. Tap the
 se apples to receive Tart Apples\, Sweet Apples\, Syrupy Apples\, or encou
 nters with event-themed Pokémon.\nPokémon: Flower Crown Cottonee\, Skidd
 o\, Applin\, Lechonk\, Smoliv\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\nThe following Poké
 mon and more will appear in the wild during the event.\nPokémon: Shroomis
 h\, Foongus\, Skwovet\, Lechonk\, Smoliv\nIf you’re lucky\, you might al
 so encounter Applin or Snorlax!\nPokémon: Snorlax\, Applin\nFrom October 
 2 at 12:00 a.m. to October 5 at 8:00 p.m. local time\, the following addit
 ional Pokémon will appear in the wild during Harvest Festival: Taken Over
 .\n\n▸ Taken Over Spawns\nPokémon: Ekans\, Koffing\, Magmar\, Slugma\, 
 Numel\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\n▸ Field Research Task Encounters\nEvent
 -themed Field Research tasks will reward encounters with event-themed Pok
 émon.\n• Catch 5 Grass‑type Pokémon → Foongus\, Skwovet\, Smoliv\n
 • Catch 15 Grass‑type Pokémon → Applin\n• Use 10 Berries to help 
 catch Pokémon → Smoliv\n• Use 20 Berries to help catch Pokémon → S
 weet Apple ×1\, Syrupy Apple ×1\, Tart Apple ×1\n\n▸ Branching Timed 
 Research\nAfter the first step\, choose one of three paths. Your choice de
 termines the apple rewards in Step 2:\n• Flapple: Tart Apples\n• Apple
 tun: Sweet Apples\n• Dipplin: Syrupy Apples\nComplete the Timed Research
  tasks and claim all rewards by Monday\, October 5\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. l
 ocal time.\n\n▸ Flapple Path\n\n▸ Appletun Path\n\n▸ Dipplin Path\n\
 n━━ GO PASS ━━\n▸ GO Pass: Harvest Festival\nTrainers will autom
 atically receive the free GO Pass: Harvest Festival on Tuesday\, September
  29\, at 10:00 a.m. local time. Complete Pass Tasks and collect GO Points 
 to rank up and earn rewards until Monday\, October 5\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m.
  local time.\n\n▸ GO Pass Deluxe\nUpgrade to GO Pass Deluxe for US$4.99*
  for additional rewards and faster progression. The GO Pass Deluxe + 6 Ran
 ks option costs US$6.99* and grants enough GO Points to reach Rank 7.\nGO 
 Pass Deluxe includes rewards from both the free and paid tracks. You can u
 pgrade at any time during the event and claim rewards from ranks you’ve 
 already unlocked.\nAll unlocked GO Pass rewards must be claimed by Wednesd
 ay\, October 7\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time.\n\n▸ Featured Pokémon 
 and Rewards\nThe free GO Pass includes the following rewards and more:\n
 • Encounters with event-themed Pokémon\n• Tart Apples\, Sweet Apples\
 , or Syrupy Apples\n• Mossy Lure Module\n• Super Rocket Radar\nGO Pass
  Deluxe adds the following rewards and more:\n• Additional encounters wi
 th event-themed Pokémon\n• Apples\n• Mossy Lure Modules\n• Super Ro
 cket Radar\n\n▸ Daily Tasks\n• Catch 5 Grass-type Pokémon — 25 GO P
 oints\n• Use 10 Berries to help catch Pokémon — 25 GO Points\n\n▸ D
 aily Tasks – Deluxe\n• Catch 10 Pokémon — 100 GO Points\n\n▸ Addi
 tional Pass Task\n• Catch an Applin — 50 GO Points\n\n▸ GO Pass: Har
 vest Festival\nRank up and earn Harvest Festival rewards!\n• Win a raid1
 00 PTS\n• Hatch an Egg40 PTS\n• Catch a Pokémon5 PTS\n\n━━ SHINY 
 ━━\n▸ Shiny Debut\nShiny Applin will be available for the first time
  in Pokémon GO! Evolve Shiny Applin to obtain its Shiny Evolutions.\nPok
 émon: Applin\, Flapple\, Appletun\, Dipplin\, Hydrapple\n\n▸ Increased 
 Shiny Chance\nThere will be an increased chance to encounter Shiny Smoliv 
 during the event. Its Shiny Evolutions are shown below as well.\nPokémon:
  Smoliv\, Dolliv\, Arboliva\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/harvest-fe
 stival-2026/
