UID:harvest-festival-taken-over-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261023T191227Z
SUMMARY:Harvest Festival: Taken Over
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261002T000000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261005T200000
DESCRIPTION:Rescue Shadow Zekrom as Team GO Rocket takes over the Harvest F
 estival!\nThe Harvest Festival: Taken Over event will take place from Octo
 ber 2\, 2026 at 12 am to October 5\, 2026 at 8 pm local time.\n\n━━ BO
 NUSES ━━\n• Increased chance to encounter Shiny Slugma\n• More Tea
 m GO Rocket appearances at PokéStops and balloons appearing every 2 hours
 \n• Use a Charged TM to remove Frustration from Shadow Pokémon\n• Wid
 er Attack\, Defense\, and HP variance for Pokémon caught in one-star and 
 three-star Shadow Raids during the event\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Sa
 ve Shadow Zekrom!\nEarn a Super Rocket Radar through GO Pass: Harvest Fest
 ival to track down Giovanni and rescue Shadow Zekrom. Giovanni will only a
 ppear at PokéStops.\nGO Pass rewards can be claimed until Wednesday\, Oct
 ober 7\, 2026\, at 8:00 pm local time.\nShadow Pokémon and Purified Poké
 mon cannot fuse with other Pokémon.\nPokémon: Zekrom\n\n━━ SHADOW 
 ━━\nTeam GO Rocket Grunts and Leaders Sierra\, Cliff\, and Arlo will c
 hange their lineups. Defeat Grunts to rescue these newly released Shadow P
 okémon.\n\n▸ New Shadow Pokémon\nPokémon: Wimpod\, Fomantis\, Sandyga
 st\nCheck the Team GO Rocket lineups page for updates after the event begi
 ns.\n\n▸ Team GO Rocket Leaders\nTeam GO Rocket Leaders Cliff\, Sierra\,
  and Arlo are using the following Pokémon in their lineups:\n• Cliff - 
 Cubone\n• Sierra - Pancham\n• Arlo - Alolan Grimer\nPokémon: Cubone\,
  Pancham\, Alolan Grimer\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\nThe following Pokémon w
 ill appear in the wild during Harvest Festival: Taken Over.\nPokémon: Eka
 ns\, Koffing\, Magmar\, Slugma\, Numel\nAs a reminder\, Pokémon from Harv
 est Festival: Applin Picking will continue to appear in the wild during th
 e event.\n\n▸ Harvest Festival Spawns\nPokémon: Snorlax\, Shroomish\, F
 oongus\, Skwovet\, Applin\, Lechonk\, Smoliv\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\n
 ▸ Field Research Tasks\nEvent Field Research will reward Fast TMs\, Char
 ged TMs\, and Mysterious Components. Tasks and item quantities have not be
 en announced.\n• ??? → Fast TM ×?\, Charged TM ×?\, Mysterious Compo
 nent ×?\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\n▸ Shiny Shroodle Debut\nShiny Shroodle 
 will be available to hatch for the first time in Pokémon GO! Evolve Shiny
  Shroodle to obtain Shiny Grafaiai.\nPokémon: Shroodle\, Grafaiai\n\n▸ 
 Increased Shiny Chance\nSlugma encounters will have an increased chance of
  being Shiny during the event.\nPokémon: Slugma\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.
 com/events/harvest-festival-taken-over-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/harvest-festival-taken-over-2026/
