BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:go-pass-october-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261023T191227Z
SUMMARY:GO Pass: October
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261006T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261103T100000
DESCRIPTION:Kyogre makes waves and the Lucky Trinket returns in GO Pass: Oc
 tober!\nThe GO Pass and GO Pass Deluxe for October will be available from 
 October 6\, 2026 at 10:00 am to November 3\, 2026 at 10:00 am local time.\
 n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ GO Pass and GO Pass Deluxe\nTrainers will a
 utomatically receive GO Pass: October on Tuesday\, October 6\, at 10:00 a.
 m. local time. You can collect GO Points and rank up to get additional rew
 ards through Tuesday\, November 3\, at 10:00 a.m. local time.\nAdditionall
 y\, from Saturday\, October 31\, at 12:00 a.m. to Sunday\, November 1\, at
  11:59 p.m. local time\, there’s no daily limit for how many GO Points y
 ou can earn!\nFor US$7.99*\, Trainers can upgrade to the GO Pass Deluxe\, 
 a paid version of the GO Pass that offers upgraded rewards and faster prog
 ression.\nFor US$9.99*\, Trainers can upgrade to the GO Pass Deluxe + 10 R
 anks to also automatically earn enough GO Points to reach Rank 11.\nWhile 
 progressing through the GO Pass Deluxe\, you’ll be able to claim all of 
 the rewards from both the free GO Pass and GO Pass Deluxe. You can upgrade
  to a GO Pass Deluxe at any time and still collect rewards from previously
  unlocked ranks.\nRewards unlocked in the GO Pass will expire on Thursday\
 , November 5\, at 10:00 a.m. local time\, so be sure to claim your rewards
  before they’re gone!\n\n▸ Featured Pokémon and Rewards\nComplete Pas
 s Tasks to rank up your GO Pass to earn the following rewards.\n• Encoun
 ter with Kyogre*\n• Rare Candy XL\n• Premium Battle Pass\n• Lucky Eg
 g\n• And even more goodies!\nTrainers who upgrade to the GO Pass Deluxe 
 can also earn the following rewards.\n• A Lucky Trinket\n• One Super I
 ncubator\n• Additional encounters with even more Pokémon!\n• And even
  more goodies!\n\n▸ Major Milestone Bonuses\nReach Major Milestones on y
 our GO Pass to unlock the following bonuses.\n\n▸ Tier 1 – Rank 1\n•
  One additional Candy for trading Pokémon\n• Trainers level 31 and abov
 e will receive one guaranteed Candy XL when trading Pokémon\n\n▸ Tier 2
  – Rank 25\n• Open up to 40 Gifts per day\n• Receive up to 125 Gifts
  per day from spinning PokéStop and Gym Photo Discs\n• Hold 10 more Gif
 ts in your Item Bag\n\n▸ Tier 3 – Rank 50\n• 2× Daily Adventure Inc
 ense duration\n\n▸ Tier 4 – Rank 75\n…\n\n━━ GO PASS ━━\nEar
 n points to increase your rank and unlock rewards. You can earn points by 
 completing Pass Tasks or the various accomplishments listed here. Any rewa
 rds you earn for completing a Pass Task will be awarded as soon as you fin
 ish the task.\nTrainers will also have access to Weekly Tasks to earn poin
 ts and increase their rank. The Weekly Tasks are as follows:\n• Catch 75
  Pokémon - 200 PTS\n• Win a raid - 150 PTS\n• Make 20 Great Throws - 
 150 PTS\n• Hatch 3 Eggs - 150 PTS\n• Spin 25 PokéStops or Gyms - 100 
 PTS\n• Use 20 Berries to help catch Pokémon - 100 PTS\n• Earn 10 hear
 ts with your buddy - 150 PTS\nThere is also a daily task:\nGO Pass: Octobe
 r Daily\n• Catch 15 Pokémon - 200 PTS\nGO Pass Deluxe: October Daily\n
 • Catch 15 Pokémon - 200 PTS\nTrainers can earn up to 250 extra points 
 daily by completing certain tasks.\n• Win a raid - 100 PTS\n• Hatch an
  Egg - 40 PTS\n• Catch a Pokémon - 5 PTS\n\n▸ GO Pass: October\nEncou
 nter Kyogre!\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/go-pass-october-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/go-pass-october-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
