BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fall-marathon-buddy-trek-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261023T191227Z
SUMMARY:Fall Marathon: Buddy Trek
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261013T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261019T200000
DESCRIPTION:Bramblin makes its Pokémon GO debut during Fall Marathon: Budd
 y Trek! Explore up to 42 km to earn Marathon Visor Pikachu\, enjoy increas
 ed chances of encountering Shiny Electrike and Shiny Hisuian Growlithe\, a
 nd unlock new GO Pass rewards.\nThe event runs from Tuesday\, October 13\,
  at 10:00 a.m. to Monday\, October 19\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time.\n\
 n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Pokémon Debut\nBramblin\, the Tumbleweed Pok
 émon\, will make its Pokémon GO debut!\nYou may encounter Bramblin throu
 gh GO Pass tasks\, Incense\, and event-themed Field Research.\nYou can evo
 lve Bramblin into Brambleghast using 50 Bramblin Candy after walking 20 km
  with Bramblin as your buddy.\nPokémon: Bramblin\, Brambleghast\n\n▸ Me
 ga Manectric\nMega Manectric can reach Super Max Level and gains access to
  the new Charged Attack Discharge+.\nPokémon: Mega Manectric\n\n▸ Disch
 arge+\nManectric gains access to this additional Charged Attack while Mega
  Evolved.\n• Trainer Battles: 50 power\n• Raid Battles: 150 power\nThe
  attack becomes stronger as the Pokémon’s Mega Level increases.\nTo rea
 ch Super Max Level\, first raise Manectric to Mega Level 3 (Max). Mega Evo
 lving alone is not enough to progress to Super Max\; you must also use Man
 ectric Mega Energy to power it up.\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\n▸ Wild Encou
 nters\nThese event-themed Pokémon may appear in the wild\, along with oth
 ers.\nPokémon: Ponyta\, Doduo\, Stantler\, Electrike\, Cacnea\, Blitzle\n
 You might also encounter Skarmory!\nPokémon: Skarmory\n\n▸ Incense Enco
 unters\nIncense will attract the following Pokémon during each period. Da
 ily Adventure Incense is excluded.\n\n▸ October 13 at 10:00 a.m. to Octo
 ber 16 at 10:00 a.m. local time\nPokémon: Galarian Ponyta\, Hoppip\, Elec
 trike\, Dwebble\, Bramblin\n\n▸ October 16 at 10:00 a.m. to October 19 a
 t 8:00 p.m. local time\nPokémon: Hisuian Growlithe\, Nincada\, Electrike\
 , Helioptile\, Bramblin\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\n▸ Field Research Task
  Rewards\nComplete event-themed Field Research tasks to earn Pokémon enco
 unters\, Manectric Mega Energy\, or Rare Candy.\n• Earn a Candy explorin
 g with your buddy → Bramblin\, Electrike\n• Explore 1 km → Cacnea\, 
 Doduo\, Electrike\n• Explore 3 km → Manectric Mega Energy ×25\, Rare 
 Candy ×1\n• Spin a PokéStop you haven't visited before → Manectric M
 ega Energy ×25\, Rare Candy ×1\nFree Timed Research will reward 16\,800 
 XP and an encounter with Marathon Visor Pikachu. Explore up to 42 km to co
 mplete the research.\nFinish the tasks and claim all rewards by Monday\, O
 ctober 19\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time.\n\n━━ GO PASS ━━\n▸ 
 GO Pass: Fall Marathon\nGO Pass: Fall Marathon is a free progression track
 . Complete Pass Tasks to collect GO Points\, increase your rank\, and unlo
 ck rewards.\nTrainers will receive the pass automatically on October 13 at
  10:00 a.m. local time. Earn points and rank up until October 19\, 2026\, 
 at 8:00 p.m. local time.\n\n▸ GO Pass Deluxe\nUpgrade to GO Pass Deluxe 
 for US$4.99* for upgraded rewards and faster progression. The GO Pass Delu
 xe + 6 Ranks option costs US$6.99* and grants enough GO Points to reach Ra
 nk 7 immediately.\nDeluxe includes rewards from both tracks. You can upgra
 de during the event and claim rewards for ranks you have already reached.\
 nClaim all unlocked GO Pass rewards before they expire on Wednesday\, Octo
 ber 21\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time.\n\n▸ Featured Pokémon and Rewa
 rds\nThe free track includes:\n• Encounters with event-themed Pokémon\n
 • Incense\n• Rare Candy\n• Ultra Balls\n• Additional rewards\nGO P
 ass Deluxe also offers:\n• Additional encounters with event-themed Poké
 mon\n• Incense\n• Manectric Mega Energy\n• Rare Candy XL\n• Additi
 onal rewards\n\n▸ Major Milestone Bonuses\nReach these GO Pass ranks to 
 unlock event bonuses.\n\n▸ Tier 1 Bonus Starting at Rank 10\n• Incense
  (excluding Daily Adventure Incense) activated during the event lasts for 
 two hours\n\n▸ Tier 2 Bonus Starting at Rank 20\n• 5× Mega Energy fro
 m exploring with Electrike or Manectric as your buddy after Mega Evolving 
 Manectric at least once\n\n▸ How to Earn Points\nComplete Pass Tasks to 
 collect GO Points\, increase your rank\, and unlock rewards. Additional bo
 nus tasks will be available during the event.\n\n▸ Daily Tasks\n• Use 
 an Incense — 50 GO Points\n• Explore 1 km — 50 GO Points\n\n▸ GO P
 ass Rewards\n…\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\nYou will have an increased chance
  of encountering Shiny Electrike throughout the event.\nThe increased chan
 ce of encountering Shiny Hisuian Growlithe applies to Incense encounters f
 rom October 16 at 10:00 a.m. to October 19\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local tim
 e. Daily Adventure Incense is excluded.\nPokémon: Hisuian Growlithe\, Ele
 ctrike\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/fall-marathon-buddy-trek-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/fall-marathon-buddy-trek-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
