 \n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\n• 2× Candy from hatching Eggs*\n• 1/2 Egg 
 Hatch Distance*\n• Increased chance of hatching Shiny Sandile\n• Incre
 ased chance of receiving 2 km Eggs from spinning PokéStops\n*These bonuse
 s do not stack with bonuses from other Pokémon GO events or GO Passes.\n\
 n▸ Ticketed Bonus\nThe optional paid Timed Research ticket grants the fo
 llowing bonus during the event.\n• 1/4 Egg Hatch Distance*\n*This bonus 
 does not stack with bonuses from other Pokémon GO events or GO Passes.\n\
 n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Featured Pokémon\nSandile will hatch more fr
 equently from 2 km Eggs during the event.\nPokémon: Sandile\n\n━━ RES
 EARCH ━━\nEvent-exclusive Timed Research awarding an Incubator and 2\,
 026 XP will be available at no cost!\nFor US$1.99 (or the equivalent prici
 ng tier in your local currency)\, you’ll be able to access event-exclusi
 ve Timed Research. Purchasing this ticket will also grant the following bo
 nus during Sandile Hatch Day. Ticket availability may vary by region.\n•
  1/4 Egg Hatch Distance*\nThis paid Timed Research will challenge you to e
 xplore 1 km and earn Stardust to earn the following items.\n• One Star P
 iece\n• Two Super Incubators\n• 5\,000 Stardust\n• 10\,000 XP\n\n━
 ━ SHINY ━━\nShiny Sandile has an increased hatch chance during the e
 vent. Its evolutions are shown below as well.\nPokémon: Sandile\, Krokoro
 k\, Krookodile\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/sandile-hatch-day-2026/
