BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:halloween-2026-part-1@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261023T191227Z
SUMMARY:Pokémon GO Halloween 2026 Part I
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261027T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261101T100000
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Halloween with the debut of Pikachu wearing a hat and
  capelet\, Zubat wearing a top hat\, and Sinistea wearing a bow! Discover 
 spooky surprises in the wild and unlock Candy and Stardust bonuses with th
 e event GO Pass.\nHalloween 2026 Part I runs from Tuesday\, October 27\, a
 t 10:00 a.m. to Sunday\, November 1\, 2026\, at 10:00 a.m. local time.\nTh
 e celebration continues in Halloween 2026 Part II\, featuring Shiny Greava
 rd’s debut and Mega Sableye’s new Super Max level.\n\n━━ BONUSES 
 ━━\nReach Major Milestones on GO Pass: Halloween 2026 to unlock these 
 bonuses.\n\n▸ Tier 1 – Rank 10\n• 2× Candy for catching Pokémon\n
 • GO Pass Deluxe: 3× Candy for catching Pokémon\n\n▸ Tier 2 – Rank
  20\n• 2× Stardust for catching Pokémon\n• GO Pass Deluxe: 3× Stard
 ust for catching Pokémon\nAdditional bonus tasks for this GO Pass will be
  available during the event.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Pokémon Debut
 s\nThe following costumed Pokémon make their Pokémon GO debuts. All thre
 e can also be Shiny!\nPokémon: Pikachu wearing a hat and capelet\, Zubat 
 wearing a top hat\, Sinistea wearing a bow\n\n▸ Trick or Treat!\nLook fo
 r spooky surprises left by mischievous Pokémon in the wild. Tap them for 
 a chance to receive event-themed Pokémon encounters\, Pikachu Candy\, Zub
 at Candy\, Sinistea Candy\, or\, if you’re lucky\, Rare Candy!\n\n▸ La
 vender Town Music and Halloween Decor\nA Lavender Town music remix will pl
 ay nightly during the Halloween event. You can also listen to it on YouTub
 e.\nDuring both parts of the event\, Pokémon encounters\, PokéStops\, an
 d Gyms will have Halloween decorations.\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\nEvent-the
 med Pokémon appearing in the wild include the following\, with more encou
 nters to discover.\nPokémon: Zubat wearing a top hat\, Duskull\, Piplup w
 earing a Halloween Mischief costume\nIf you’re lucky\, you might also en
 counter Drifblim wearing a Halloween Mischief costume! All Pokémon listed
  above can be Shiny.\n\n━━ RAIDS ━━\n▸ One-Star Raids\nThe follo
 wing Pokémon will appear in one-star raids. Both can be Shiny!\nPokémon:
  Pikachu wearing a hat and capelet\, Sinistea wearing a bow\n\n━━ RESE
 ARCH ━━\n▸ Field Research\nComplete event-themed Field Research task
 s to encounter event-themed Pokémon. Specific tasks and encounters have n
 ot yet been announced.\n\n━━ GO PASS ━━\n▸ GO Pass: Halloween 20
 26\nGO Pass: Halloween 2026 is available from October 27 at 10:00 a.m. to 
 November 5\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time\, spanning both parts of Hallo
 ween. Trainers automatically receive the free pass when it begins. Complet
 e Pass Tasks to collect GO Points\, increase your rank\, and earn rewards.
 \nThe free pass includes:\n• Encounters with event-themed Pokémon\n• 
 Candy for event-themed Pokémon\n• Rare Candy\n• Ultra Balls\n• Addi
 tional rewards\nGO Pass Deluxe costs US$7.99 (or the equivalent local pric
 ing tier). It offers faster progression and additional rewards\, including
 :\n• Additional encounters with event-themed Pokémon\n• Patissier Top
  and Patissier Pants\n• Rare Candy XL\n• Premium Battle Passes\n• Ad
 ditional rewards\nFor US$9.99 (or the equivalent local pricing tier)\, GO 
 Pass Deluxe + 10 Ranks also provides enough GO Points to reach Rank 11.\nD
 eluxe includes rewards from both tracks. You can upgrade at any time while
  the pass is available and claim rewards for ranks you have already reache
 d. Availability may vary by region.\nClaim all unlocked rewards by Novembe
 r 7\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time\, before they expire.\n\n━━ SHINY
  ━━\nPikachu wearing a hat and capelet\, Zubat wearing a top hat\, and
  Sinistea wearing a bow will be available in their Shiny variants from the
 ir debut!\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/halloween-2026-part-1/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/halloween-2026-part-1/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
