DESCRIPTION:Giratina (Origin) will be in five-star raid battles from Octobe
 r 28\, 2026 to November 3\, 2026.\n\n▸ Raid Hours\nThere will also be a 
 Raid Hour featuring Giratina (Origin Forme) from 6:00 p.m. to 7:00 p.m. lo
