BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:halloween-2026-part-2@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261023T191227Z
SUMMARY:Pokémon GO Halloween 2026 Part II
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261101T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261105T200000
DESCRIPTION:Shiny Greavard makes its Pokémon GO debut\, and Mega Sableye c
 an reach the new Super Max Mega Level! Halloween continues with costumed P
 okémon\, themed encounters\, and GO Pass bonuses.\nHalloween 2026 Part II
  runs from Sunday\, November 1\, at 10:00 a.m. to Thursday\, November 5\, 
 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time.\nSee Halloween 2026 Part I for the first p
 art of the celebration\, including the debut of costumed Pikachu\, Zubat\,
  and Sinistea.\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\nReach Major Milestones on GO Pass
 : Halloween 2026 to unlock these bonuses.\n\n▸ Tier 1 – Rank 10\n• 2
 × Candy for catching Pokémon\n• GO Pass Deluxe: 3× Candy for catching
  Pokémon\n\n▸ Tier 2 – Rank 20\n• 2× Stardust for catching Pokémo
 n\n• GO Pass Deluxe: 3× Stardust for catching Pokémon\nLook out for ad
 ditional bonus tasks for the event GO Pass.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸
  Mega Sableye: Super Max Level\nStarting with this event\, Mega Sableye ca
 n reach Super Max Level for the first time in Pokémon GO.\nPokémon: Mega
  Sableye\nFirst\, increase Sableye’s Mega Level to Max\, the third level
 . To progress to Super Max\, you’ll need to use Sableye Mega Energy to p
 ower it up\; Mega Evolving alone is not enough.\n\n▸ Night Shade+\nSable
 ye can now use the additional Charged Attack Night Shade+ while Mega Evolv
 ed. Its power increases with the Pokémon’s Mega Level.\n• Trainer Bat
 tles: 55 power\n• Raid Battles: 160 power\nLearn more about Super Max Me
 ga Levels and additional Mega-Evolved Charged Attacks.\n\n━━ SPAWNS 
 ━━\nThe announced wild encounters include the following Pokémon\, wit
 h more event-themed encounters to discover. All Pokémon listed here can b
 e Shiny!\nPokémon: Litwick\, Rowlet wearing a Pokémon Halloween costume\
 , Greavard\nIf you’re lucky\, you might also encounter Gengar wearing a 
 Spooky Festival costume!\nPokémon: Gengar wearing a Spooky Festival costu
 me\n\n━━ RAIDS ━━\n▸ One-Star Raids\nThe following Pokémon will
  appear in one-star raids. Both can be Shiny!\nPokémon: Pikachu wearing a
  hat and capelet\, Sinistea wearing a bow\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\n▸ F
 ield Research\nComplete event-themed Field Research tasks for encounters w
 ith event-themed Pokémon\, including Greavard. Specific tasks and the ful
 l encounter list have not yet been announced.\n\n━━ GO PASS ━━\n
 ▸ GO Pass: Halloween 2026\nThe same Halloween GO Pass continues through 
 Part II. It is available from October 27 at 10:00 a.m. to November 5\, 202
 6\, at 8:00 p.m. local time. Trainers automatically receive the free pass 
 when it begins. Complete Pass Tasks to collect GO Points\, increase your r
 ank\, and unlock rewards. Greavard is among the Pokémon you can encounter
  through GO Pass tasks.\nThe free pass includes:\n• Encounters with even
 t-themed Pokémon\n• Candy for event-themed Pokémon\n• Rare Candy\n
 • Ultra Balls\n• Additional rewards\nGO Pass Deluxe costs US$7.99 (or 
 the equivalent local pricing tier). It offers faster progression and addit
 ional rewards\, including:\n• Additional encounters with event-themed Po
 kémon\n• Patissier Top and Patissier Pants\n• Rare Candy XL\n• Prem
 ium Battle Passes\n• Additional rewards\nFor US$9.99 (or the equivalent 
 local pricing tier)\, GO Pass Deluxe + 10 Ranks also provides enough GO Po
 ints to reach Rank 11.\nDeluxe includes rewards from both tracks. You can 
 upgrade at any time while the pass is available and claim rewards for rank
 s you have already reached. Availability may vary by region.\nClaim all un
 locked rewards by November 7\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time\, before the
 y expire.\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\nShiny Greavard makes its Pokémon GO deb
 ut! You may encounter it in the wild or through GO Pass and Field Research
  tasks.\nPokémon: Greavard\, Houndstone\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/even
 ts/halloween-2026-part-2/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/halloween-2026-part-2/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
