SUMMARY:GO Pass: November
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261103T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261201T100000
DESCRIPTION:Earn PokéCoins and encounter Groudon in GO Pass: November!\nTh
 e GO Pass and GO Pass Deluxe for November will be available from November 
 3\, 2026 at 10:00 am to December 1\, 2026 at 10:00 am local time.\n\n━
 ━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ GO Pass and GO Pass Deluxe\nTrainers will automat
 ically receive GO Pass: November on Tuesday\, November 3\, at 10:00 a.m. l
 ocal time. You can collect GO Points and rank up to get additional rewards
  through Tuesday\, December 1\, at 10:00 a.m. local time.\nAdditionally\, 
 from Saturday\, November 28\, at 12:00 a.m. to Sunday\, November 29\, at 1
 1:59 p.m. local time\, there’s no daily limit for how many GO Points you
  can earn!\nFor US$7.99*\, Trainers can upgrade to the GO Pass Deluxe\, a 
 paid version of the GO Pass that offers upgraded rewards and faster progre
 ssion.\nFor US$9.99*\, Trainers can upgrade to the GO Pass Deluxe + 10 Ran
 ks to also automatically earn enough GO Points to reach Rank 11.\nWhile pr
 ogressing through the GO Pass Deluxe\, you’ll be able to claim all of th
 e rewards from both the free GO Pass and GO Pass Deluxe. You can upgrade t
 o a GO Pass Deluxe at any time and still collect rewards from previously u
 nlocked ranks.\nRewards unlocked in the GO Pass will expire on Thursday\, 
 December 3\, at 10:00 a.m. local time\, so be sure to claim your rewards b
 efore they’re gone!\n\n▸ Featured Pokémon and Rewards\nComplete Pass 
 Tasks to rank up your GO Pass to earn the following rewards.\n• Encounte
 r with Groudon*\n• 400 PokéCoins\n• Lucky Egg\n• Rare Candy XL\n•
  Stardust\n• And even more goodies!\nTrainers who upgrade to the GO Pass
  Deluxe can also earn the following rewards.\n• 1\,000 additional PokéC
 oins for a total of 1\,400 PokéCoins\n• One Super Incubator\n• Additi
 onal encounters with even more Pokémon!\n• And even more goodies!\n\n
 ▸ Major Milestone Bonuses\nReach Major Milestones on your GO Pass to unl
 ock the following bonuses.\n\n▸ Tier 1 – Rank 1\n• One additional Ca
 ndy for trading Pokémon\n• Trainers level 31 and above will receive one
  guaranteed Candy XL when trading Pokémon\n\n▸ Tier 2 – Rank 25\n• 
 Open up to 40 Gifts per day\n• Receive up to 125 Gifts per day from spin
 ning PokéStop and Gym Photo Discs\n• Hold 10 more Gifts in your Item Ba
 g\n\n▸ Tier 3 – Rank 50\n• 2× Daily Adventure Incense duration\n…
 \n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/go-pass-november-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/go-pass-november-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
