 nse\, and HP ratings and be XL or XXL. They are harder to catch\, and some
  may be Shiny. GO Safari Balls improve your chances of catching them.\nMig
 hty Pokémon can appear during either habitat hour. The in-person lineup i
 ncludes mighty Machamp wearing a modern jacket\, Bastiodon\, and Kommo-o\,
