BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:into-the-wild-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261023T191227Z
SUMMARY:Into the Wild
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261109T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261113T200000
DESCRIPTION:It’s time to head back Into the Wild for a Steel- and Dragon-
 type adventure! Regidrago makes its Dynamax debut in five-star Max Battles
 \, Dynamax Meltan debuts in GO Pass: Into the Wild\, and Crowned Sword Zac
 ian and Crowned Shield Zamazenta take over five-star raids as Pokémon GO 
 Wild Area 2026 approaches.\n\n▸ Related Events\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\
 n• Remote Raid limit increased to 30 from Monday\, November 9\, to Frida
 y\, November 13\, 2026\n• No Remote Raid limit from Saturday\, November 
 14\, to Sunday\, November 15\, 2026\n• Chance to encounter Shiny Gimmigh
 oul when using a Coin Bag*\n• Chance to encounter Shiny Meltan when open
 ing the Mystery Box*\n• Reduced wait time before you can open the Myster
 y Box again*\n• Trainers can receive special event stickers from PokéSt
 ops and Gifts\n* These bonuses will be available from Monday\, November 9\
 , at 10:00 a.m. to Sunday\, November 15\, 2026\, at 6:00 p.m. local time.\
 nDaily Discoveries will not take place from November 9 through November 15
 \, 2026.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Dynamax Pokémon Debuts\nRegidrago
  will make its Pokémon GO Dynamax debut in five-star Max Battles\, and Me
 ltan will make its Dynamax debut in GO Pass: Into the Wild. If you’re lu
 cky\, you may encounter a Shiny one!\nPokémon: Regidrago\, Meltan\n\n▸ 
 Meltan and the Mystery Box\nThe Mystery Box is the key to catching Meltan.
  You can get one by sending a Pokémon from Pokémon GO to Pokémon HOME\,
  or to Pokémon: Let’s Go\, Pikachu! or Pokémon: Let’s Go\, Eevee! on
  Nintendo Switch.\nFrom Monday\, November 9\, at 10:00 a.m. to Sunday\, No
 vember 15\, at 6:00 p.m. local time\, opening the Mystery Box gives you a 
 chance to encounter Shiny Meltan\, and you won’t have to wait as long be
 fore you can open it again.\n\n▸ New Special Background!\nTrainers who t
 ake part in five-star raids and five-star Max Battles during the Into the 
 Wild event will have a chance of receiving a new Special Background after 
 a successful catch. The souvenir background appears on the Pokémon’s su
 mmary page\, showing when it was caught on the road to Pokémon GO Wild Ar
 ea!\n\n▸ Into the Wild Global Challenge\nWork with Trainers around the w
 orld to complete raids and Max Battles. Completing the Into the Wild Globa
 l Challenge unlocks the following bonuses.\n• The Adventure Effect for C
 rowned Sword Zacian’s Behemoth Blade will be more effective.\n• The Ad
 venture Effect for Crowned Shield Zamazenta’s Behemoth Bash will be more
  effective.\n• Energy collected during Max Battles will fill the meter f
 aster.\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\nThe following Pokémon will appear more fr
 equently in the wild\, along with other event-themed Pokémon.\nPokémon: 
 Magnemite\, Noibat\, Togedemaru\n\n━━ RAIDS ━━\nThe following Pok
 émon will appear in raids. Crowned Sword Zacian and Crowned Shield Zamaze
 nta will also be featured in Raid Hours from 6:00 p.m. to 7:00 p.m. local 
 time on Monday\, November 9\, and Tuesday\, November 10\, respectively.\nD
 efeating Crowned Sword Zacian or Crowned Shield Zamazenta in raids will ea
 rn you Crowned Sword Energy or Crowned Shield Energy\, respectively.\n\n
 ▸ Three-Star Raids\nPokémon: Druddigon\, Orthworm\n\n▸ Five-Star Raid
 s\nPokémon: Zacian (Crowned Sword)\, Zamazenta (Crowned Shield)\n\n▸ Ra
 id Hour: Monday\, November 9\nPokémon: Zacian (Crowned Sword)\n\n▸ Raid
  Hour: Tuesday\, November 10\nPokémon: Zamazenta (Crowned Shield)\n\n▸ 
 Max Battles\nThe following Dynamax Pokémon will appear in Max Battles. Po
 kémon appearing in five-star Max Battles will also be featured in Max Bat
 tles from 6:00 p.m. to 7:00 p.m. local time for one day each on the follow
 ing schedule.\n\n▸ One-Star Max Battles\nPokémon: Ralts\n\n▸ Two-Star
  Max Battles\nPokémon: Machop\n\n▸ Five-Star Max Battles: Wednesday\, N
 ovember 11\nPokémon: Registeel\n\n▸ Five-Star Max Battles: Thursday\, N
 ovember 12\nPokémon: Regidrago\n\n▸ Five-Star Max Battles: Friday\, Nov
 ember 13\nPokémon: Latias\, Latios\n\n━━ MOVES ━━\n▸ Featured A
 ttacks\n\n▸ Registeel\nRegisteel caught during the event will know the F
 ast Attack Metal Claw.\nPokémon: Registeel\n\n▸ Latias\nLatias caught d
 uring the event will know the Charged Attack Mist Ball.\nPokémon: Latias\
 n\n▸ Latios\nLatios caught during the event will know the Charged Attack
  Luster Purge.\nPokémon: Latios\n\n▸ Regidrago\nRegidrago caught during
  the event will know the Fast Attack Dragon Breath.\nPokémon: Regidrago\n
 \n━━ RESEARCH ━━\n▸ Field Research Tasks\nPokémon GO Wild Area
 –themed Field Research tasks will be available throughout the event! Com
 plete the research tasks to earn encounters with event-themed Pokémon and
  other rewards.\n\n━━ GO PASS ━━\n▸ GO Pass: Into the Wild\nGO P
 ass: Into the Wild is a free progression track. Complete Pass Tasks to col
 lect GO Points\, increase your rank\, and unlock rewards.\nTrainers will r
 eceive the pass automatically on Monday\, November 9\, at 10:00 a.m. local
  time. Earn points and rank up until Sunday\, November 15\, 2026\, at 6:00
  p.m. local time.\nFrom Monday\, November 9\, to Friday\, November 13\, yo
 u can collect GO Points up to a daily cap. There’s no limit to the GO Po
 ints you can earn on Saturday and Sunday\, November 14 to 15!\n\n▸ GO Pa
 ss Deluxe\nUpgrade to GO Pass Deluxe: Into the Wild for US$14.99* for upgr
 aded rewards. The GO Pass Deluxe: Into the Wild + 10 Ranks option costs US
 $19.99* and grants enough GO Points to reach Rank 10.\nDeluxe includes rew
 ards from both tracks. You can upgrade at any time and still claim rewards
  for ranks you have already reached.\nClaim all unlocked GO Pass rewards b
 efore they expire on Tuesday\, November 17\, 2026\, at 11:59 p.m. local ti
 me.\n\n▸ Featured Pokémon and Rewards\nThe free track includes:\n• En
 counter with Dynamax Meltan\n• Encounters with event-themed Pokémon\n
 • GO Wild Area 2026 Tee (Purple)\n• Stardust\n• XP\n• Poké Balls\
 n• Candy\n• Additional rewards\nGO Pass Deluxe also offers:\n• A Sil
 ver Bottle Cap\, which can be used to max one stat—Attack\, Defense\, or
  HP—on any Pokémon via Hyper Training\n• Encounters with Dynamax Melt
 an\n• Duraludon Pants\n• Premium items\, such as Incense and a Lucky E
 gg\n• Additional rewards\nPokémon: Meltan\n\n▸ Major Milestone Bonuse
 s\n…
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/into-the-wild-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
