BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:november-communityday2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261023T191227Z
SUMMARY:Pawniard Community Day
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261121T140000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261121T170000
DESCRIPTION:Pawniard\, the Sharp Blade Pokémon\, will be featured during N
 ovember Community Day!\nThe event takes place on Saturday\, November 21\, 
 2026\, from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. local time.\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\n
 • Increased Spawns\n• 1/4 Egg Hatch Distance\n• 3-hour Incense\n• 
 1-hour Lures*\n• 2x Catch Candy\n• 2x Chance for Trainers level 31 and
  up to receive Candy XL from catching Pokémon\n• One additional Special
  Trade can be made for a maximum of two for the day*\n• Trades made will
  require 50% less Stardust*\nThe reduced Egg Hatch Distance applies to Egg
 s placed in an Incubator during the event.\n* While most bonuses are only 
 active from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. local time\, these bonuses will be acti
 ve from 2:00 p.m. to 9:00 p.m. local time.\nThe three-hour Incense bonus e
 xcludes Daily Adventure Incense and the one-hour Lure bonus excludes Golde
 n Lure Modules.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Featured Attack\nEvolve Bis
 harp during the event or up to four hours afterwards to get a Kingambit th
 at knows the Charged Attack Kowtow Cleave.\n\n▸ Kowtow Cleave (Dark-type
 )\n• Trainer Battles: 75 power\n• Gyms and raids: 85 power\n\n▸ Limi
 ted-time Evolution Requirement\nFrom 2:00 p.m. to 9:00 p.m. local time\, e
 volve Bisharp into Kingambit after defeating 1 Dark- or Steel-type Raid Bo
 ss.\nThis bonus applies to all of your Bisharp\, regardless of whether the
 y are your Buddy Pokémon. The usual evolution requirements return on Satu
 rday\, November 21\, 2026\, at 9:00 p.m. local time.\n\n▸ Photobomb\nTak
 e a few snapshots during Community Day for a surprise! During the event\, 
 you can snap an AR Photo and get photobombed by Pawniard.\nPokémon: Pawni
 ard\n\n▸ Lure Module Bonus\nFrom 2:00 p.m. to 9:00 p.m. local time\, Paw
 niard will have a very high chance of appearing at PokéStops with active 
 regular Lure Modules.\nPawniard attracted to regular Lure Modules will sti
 ll have an increased chance to be Shiny and may have a Special Background.
  That’s more chances to encounter the featured Pokémon even after the e
 vent hours!\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\nPawniard will appear more frequently 
 in the wild. If you’re lucky\, you might encounter a Shiny one or one th
 at has a Special Background!\nPokémon: Pawniard\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━
 \n▸ Field Research Tasks\nNovember Community Day–themed Field Research
  will be available! Catch Pawniard to earn rewards such as Stardust\, Ultr
 a Balls\, additional encounters with Pawniard\, and more! You may even fin
 d Field Research that leads to encounters with Pawniard that have a Specia
 l Background—if you’re lucky!\n• Catch 3 Pawniard → Pawniard\, Gre
 at Ball ×5\, Ultra Ball ×2\, Pinap Berry ×2\, Stardust ×500\nThe follo
 wing tasks will have encounters with Special Backgrounds.\n• Catch 5 Pok
 emon while in a Party → Pawniard\n• Catch 50 Pokemon → Pawniard\nFor
  US$1.99 (or the equivalent pricing tier in your local currency)\, you’l
 l be able to access the Pawniard Community Day–exclusive Special Researc
 h. Complete this research for rewards including:\n• 3 encounters with Pa
 wniard that have a Special Background\n• Additional encounters with Pawn
 iard\n• 1 Premium Battle Pass\n• 1 Rare Candy XL\n• And more!\nYou c
 an purchase and gift tickets to friends you’ve achieved a Friendship lev
 el of Great Friends or higher with. To gift a ticket\, tap the Special Res
 earch ticket in the in-game shop\, then tap the Gift button instead of the
  Buy button.\n\n▸ Community Ambassador Check-In Timed Research\nCheck in
  at a Community Ambassador event to receive Timed Research with Pawniard e
 ncounters featuring a Special Background and other premium item rewards. F
 ind a nearby meetup on the Pokémon GO event map.\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\n
 Trainers will have an increased chance of encountering Shiny Pawniard duri
 ng Community Day. Shiny Pawniard can be evolved into Shiny Bisharp and Shi
 ny Kingambit.\nPokémon: Pawniard\, Bisharp\, Kingambit\n\n🔗 https://le
 ekduck.com/events/november-communityday2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/november-communityday2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
